      "writtenOn": "2026-02-09T14:07:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wanted to re-use this driver for few reasons:\n\n* No new config option: I can\u0027t think of any reason why you wouldn\u0027t want this feature, that is also already guarded by PM_GENERIC_DOMAINS, is completely transparent and can be ignored by the VMM by just not setting the node.\n\n* I re-use the discovery mechanism for the reasons explained in the patch below. Discovery mechanism that is supported in this driver already.\n\n* The ARM_PKVM_GUEST config gating looks appropriate, as the feature is pKVM specific.\n\n* It is very small.",
      "parentUuid": "b4dabda8_2d61ab23",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 16,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "2df90823aedb72e1e7c5a42b5441d27e8804316e",
